   "lines": [
    "# ORBIT",
    "",
    "",
    "### An autonomous AI agent that runs on voice — no wake word; it understands, does the work, talks on phone calls, and learns new skills from its own work.",
    "",
    "ORBIT is a self-built autonomous AI agent with 110+ tools. You speak, it",
    "understands the intent — no wake word, no menus — and gets the work done",
    "across the desktop, the web, and even live phone calls. After multi-step",
    "work it saves what it learned as a reusable skill, so the same task runs",
    "faster next time.",
    "",
    "Built with Python · LLM APIs · Faster Whisper · Voice AI",
    "",
    "[Visit](https://github.com/crazycoder-here)"
   ]
  },
